# MCP profile placeholder

This project was generated with the `mcp` profile placeholder.

Important: this file does **not** install, start, connect to, or implement an
MCP server or adapter. Selecting `mcp` only records the intended future
integration profile at Copier generation time.

The shared repository checkers and release gate remain authoritative. A real
MCP orchestrator will be added separately and must invoke them, stopping on
any non-zero exit status.
